      "url": "https://solar.test/",
      "path": "/",
      "title": "Home",
      "html": "\n<h2>Clean power for homes</h2>\n<p>Example Solar installs rooftop panels and batteries for homes and small businesses in Nairobi. We have installed more than four hundred systems since 2019, each one designed for the roof it sits on.</p>\n<p>Read <a href=\"https://solar.test/2026/10/01/hello-sun/\">why we started</a>, see our <a href=\"https://solar.test/products/panel-400/\">400 W panel</a>, or <a href=\"https://solar.test/contact/\">ask for a quote</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://solar.test/private/\">Staff notes</a></p>\n",
      "excerpt": "Rooftop solar for homes in Nairobi.",
      "status": "published",
      "language": "en-US"
    },
    {
      "key": "crawl:/about/",
      "kind": "page",
      "slug": "about",
      "url": "https://solar.test/about/",
      "path": "/about/",
      "title": "About us",
      "html": "\n<p>We are a team of eight engineers and installers. Every installation is surveyed, designed and wired by our own staff, and we stay on call for the life of the system.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"The installation team on a roof\" src=\"https://solar.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/team.png\"><figcaption>The team in October.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<ul><li>A free site survey</li><li>A written design and quote</li><li>Installation in two days</li></ul>\n",
      "excerpt": "Who we are and how we work.",
      "status": "published",
      "language": "en-US",
      "media": [
        "https://solar.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/team.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "crawl:/contact/",
      "kind": "page",
      "slug": "contact",
      "url": "https://solar.test/contact/",
      "path": "/contact/",
      "title": "Contact",
      "html": "\n<p>Tell us about your roof and we will reply within one working day.</p>\n<div class=\"wpcf7\"><form action=\"/contact/#wpcf7-f12-p5-o1\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" method=\"post\">\n<input name=\"_wpcf7\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"12\">\n<p><label>Your name <input name=\"your-name\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"></label></p>\n<p><label>Your email <input name=\"your-email\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"></label></p>\n<p><label>Your message <textarea name=\"your-message\"></textarea></label></p>\n<p><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Send\"></p>\n</form></div>\n",
      "excerpt": "Ask for a quote.",
      "status": "published",
      "language": "en-US"
    },
    {
      "key": "crawl:/2026/10/01/hello-sun/",
      "kind": "post",
      "slug": "hello-sun",
      "url": "https://solar.test/2026/10/01/hello-sun/",
      "path": "/2026/10/01/hello-sun/",
      "title": "Hello, sun",
      "html": "\n<p>Our first panel went up in 2019 on a school roof in Kibera. It still produces more than it did on day one, because we clean it every quarter.</p>\n<p>This blog is where we share what we learn from every installation.</p>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:-9999px\"><a href=\"https://cheap-casino.test/\">best online casino bonus</a> <a href=\"https://pills.test/buy\">cheap viagra online</a></div>\n",
      "excerpt": "Why we started.",
      "status": "published",
