      "slug": "panel-care",
      "url": "https://solar.test/2026/10/12/panel-care/",
      "path": "/2026/10/12/panel-care/",
      "title": "Caring for your panels",
      "html": "\n<p>Dust costs a panel up to a fifth of its output in the dry season. Rinse panels with clean water early in the morning, never with soap, and never climb onto the roof yourself.</p>\n<p>We include two cleaning visits a year with every installation.</p>\n",
      "excerpt": "Keep your panels producing.",
